ike Month","slug":"bike-month","term_group":0,"term_taxonomy_id":111,"taxonomy":"tribe_events_cat","description":"","parent":0,"count":2,"filter":"raw","id":111,"urls":{"self":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/categories\/111","collection":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/categories"}}],"tags":[],"venue":[],"organizer":[{"id":11405,"author":"2","status":"publish","date":"2023-03-16 16:33:54","date_utc":"2023-03-16 20:33:54","modified":"2023-03-16 16:33:54","modified_utc":"2023-03-16 20:33:54","url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/organizer\/league-of-american-bicyclists\/","organizer":"League of American Bicyclists","slug":"league-of-american-bicyclists","global_id":"bikeleague.org?id=11405","global_id_lineage":["bikeleague.org?id=11405"]}],"custom_fields":[],"ticketed":false},{"id":12257,"global_id":"bikeleague.org?id=12257","global_id_lineage":["bikeleague.org?id=12257"],"author":"7","status":"publish","date":"2023-05-05 13:49:01","date_utc":"2023-05-05 17:49:01","modified":"2023-05-12 12:05:12","modified_utc":"2023-05-12 16:05:12","url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/calendar\/bike-rooms-to-ride-for-the-story-of-allinas-commuter-center\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/12257","title":"Bike Rooms to Ride For: The Story of Allina\u2019s Commuter Center","description":"<p>During National Bike to Work Week, join Amelia Neptune, the Director of the League of American Bicyclists\u2019 Bicycle Friendly America Program and Lou Fineberg, Dero\u2019s National Advocacy Accounts Manager, as they sit down virtually with Adam Juul, Director of Facilities and Real Estate Administration at Allina Health along with Matt Lysne, Principal at HCM Architects to discuss Allina\u2019s fabulous new bike commuter center along Minneapolis\u2019 epic Midtown Greenway.<\/p>\n<p>Learn about the project from conception, to planning, and finally, execution. You will hear about the challenges, budget considerations, data collection efforts, and what forces and circumstances arose to help make this top tier facility happen. This is an excellent example of aiming big and succeeding, but it\u2019s also a story about having a vision and seeing it through. We all can learn from the experience of Matt and Adam who were closely involved in this effort.<\/p>\n<p>Get ready to experience envy, admiration, and the inspiration to create the next great bike room.<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"bike-rooms-to-ride-for-the-story-of-allinas-commuter-center","image":{"url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Bike-Rooms-to-Ride-For-Webinar.jpeg","id":12306,"extension":"jpeg","width":800,"height":800,"filesize":97120,"sizes":{"medium":{"width":300,"height":300,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":22114,"url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Bike-Rooms-to-Ride-For-Webinar-300x300.jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"width":150,"height":150,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":7178,"url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Bike-Rooms-to-Ride-For-Webinar-150x150.jpeg"},"medium_large":{"width":768,"height":768,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":91561,"url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Bike-Rooms-to-Ride-For-Webinar-768x768.jpeg"},"fiat_thumb":{"width":60,"height":60,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":1697,"url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Bike-Rooms-to-Ride-For-Webinar-60x60.jpeg"},"state":{"width":280,"height":460,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":27608,"url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Bike-Rooms-to-Ride-For-Webinar-280x460.jpeg"},"staff":{"width":500,"height":500,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":48334,"url":"https:\/\/bikeleague.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/Bike-Rooms-to-Ride-For-Webinar-500x500.jpeg"}}},"all_day":false,"start_date":"2023-05-16 15:30:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2023","month":"05","day":"16","hour":"15","minutes":"30","second